"and Black is putting up a better defense than before."
OK

"In beginning this tutorial on pawn skeletons, I started by speaking about 
Rooks. Why?  Most players have a terrible time learning to use their Rooks."
OK

"They move them back and forth or don't use them at all."
OK

"After going through these examples, learning how to use the 'clumsy' Rooks 
isn't difficult at all. In fact the principles governing Rooks are the 
easiest of all!"
OK

