OK

DIAGRAM "a5,b4,c5,e3,f2,g3,h2,Be1,Kg2 v a6,b5,e5,e4,f5,g4,h7,Ng5,Kc4" BLACK
MOVE Kd3
"If 11.c6 Ne6 and the c6-pawn will be neatly rounded up after ...Kc4-d5xc6 
and then Kc6-d5-c4 back again."
OK

DIAGRAM "a5,b4,c5,e3,f2,g3,h2,Be1,Kg2 v a6,b5,e5,e4,f5,g4,h7,Ng5,Kd3" WHITE
MOVELIST "h3 Ne6"
"A very powerful move. White is now reduced to making only King and pawn 
moves.
12.h3 Ne6!"
OK

DIAGRAM "a5,b4,c5,e3,f2,g3,h3,Be1,Kg2 v a6,b5,e5,e4,f5,g4,h7,Ne6,Kd3" WHITE
MOVELIST "hxg4 fxg4 Kf1 Nc7 Kg1 Nd5 Kf1 h6"
"Avoiding the clever trap 12...gxh3+ 13.Kh2 Nf3+? 14.Kxh3 Nxf1 15.c6! and 
