DIAGRAM "a5,b4,e3,f2,g3,Bc3,Kb3 v a6,b5,e5,e4,g4,h4,Nf3,Kd5" WHITE
MOVELIST "gxh4 Nxh4 Bd2 Nf3 Bc3"
