DIAGRAM "a5,b4,e3,f2,Bc3,Kb3 v a6,b5,e5,e4,g4,h4,Nf3,Kd5" BLACK
"This spells double trouble for the f2-pawn.  27.gxh4 Nxh4 28.Bd2 Nf3 29.Bc3"
