OK

DIAGRAM "a5,b4,e3,f2,Bd2,Kb3 v a6,b5,e5,e4,g4,h4,Ne2,Kd5" WHITE
"which means that White is compelled to make a bad move."
OK

"White would prefer to 'pass,' but is forced to make a move. However, any 
move he makes weakens his position. Thus he is in Zugzwang."
OK

"31.Kc2"
MOVE Kc2
OK

DIAGRAM "a5,b4,e3,f2,Bd2,Kc2 v a6,b5,e5,e4,g4,h4,Ne2,Kd5" BLACK
"Or 31.Be1 Nc1+ 32.Kc3 Nd3 reaching a killer outpost. White would be forced 
